- From the project root run `uv sync`
{% if include_tailwind %}
- Install the [Tailwind CSS standalone CLI](https://tailwindcss.com/blog/standalone-cli):
{% endif %}

## Running the API
{% if include_tailwind %}
Build the CSS first, then start the server:

```bash
make build-css
make run
```

While developing, you can watch for template changes in a separate terminal:

```bash
make watch-css
```
{% else %}
```bash
make run
```
{% endif %}

The API will be available at `http://localhost:8000`.  
Interactive docs are at `http://localhost:8000/docs`.

## Development

```bash
# Format code
make format

# Lint
make lint

# Run tests
make test

# Format, lint, and test
make check
```
